flowchart LR
    A([Start]) --> B[/Open public site/]
    B --> C{Choose action}
    C -- Browse --> D[View public pages and static content]
    C -- Contact or order --> E[/Enter request details/]
    E --> F[Client-side validation]
    F --> G[/Show prepared message only/]
    C -- Portal --> H{Session already in localStorage?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Read client-controlled role]
    H -- No --> J[/Sign in or create student account/]
    J --> K[(Browser localStorage users and session)]
    K --> I
    I --> L{Role route exists?}
    L -- No --> M[/Missing page or student fallback/]
    L -- Yes --> N[Open role dashboard]
    N --> O[Render mostly hardcoded dashboard data]
    D --> P([End])
    G --> P
    M --> P
    O --> P
